{"dog":{"age_group":"young","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","breed_primary":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","description_text":"My foster writes: Gumby is a sweet, quirky cat who thrives in a slow-paced environment. He loves sinking his teeth into a Purr Pop (and then the stick), stretching so much he rolls over, and chirping to express his big feelings. He can entertain himself batting his mouse toys across the house, but will ask for love and attention when he settles down for the evening. Gumby is reserved at first and takes his time getting used to new environments, but your patience will reward you with an incredibly outgoing, affectionate, and goofy companion.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=2%2C15&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=12&searchType=4&animalid=208113","id":"b9a1621dfcc79327430508c5c0ee2689","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/441ab0778cc74f1b9337a1f30fe0154e-1792589008-1792589016-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/b9f2f7de773f4a2aa5c1743a198c19e8-1789752267-1790854502-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/4339656fc0774d4aa647b4edc67b2baa-1789752229-1790797059-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/5035485d350b49f9a4eb221957915058-1789999160-1789999170-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/7adaa897dde342ab81e9415430a9031d-1789762286-1789762286-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/4baeee2c2ae64976b3d60b50779d3f21-1789752316-1789752374-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/412b0b093fa64894bb311ffcd38bee1d-1789742735-1789742735-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/5eb1ac09cfc944b79269021cbd3dce45-1794322115-1794322115-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/655905